{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超表示，在深圳出席亞太經合組織會議期間，與國家主席習近平短暫交流。他向習近平介紹了在APEC工商領導人峰會上，與會人士認同粵港澳大灣區有龐大發展潛力。<br/>\n<br/>\n李家超又說，出席今次會議達致五個成果。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：劉景輝\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:16:55.803917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:47:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:57:39.606640+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:10:19.953817+00:00","content_hash":"0310d336f7d7ff87451df59a4a831367dc60e0f82c940a30b70dbd8e0d9e2d1e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}